<title>USA: Hussey Copper raises copper to 122 cents August 4.</title>
<headline>Hussey Copper raises copper to 122 cents August 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd. has adjusted its price to reflect contained copper at 122 cents a lb, down 1 cent, effective Monday.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
